    "solution_latex": "Power dissipated is $P = I^2 R = \\frac{E^2 R}{(R + r)^2}$. Setting $dP/dR = 0$ yields $(R + r)^2 - 2R(R + r) = 0 \\implies R + r - 2R = 0 \\implies R = r$. Maximum power is $P_{\\text{max}} = \\frac{E^2}{4r}$.",
