    "solution_latex": "Using $V = E - Ir$: (1) $10 = E - 2r$, (2) $9 = E - 3r$. Subtracting (2) from (1): $1 = r \\implies r = 1.0\\,\\Omega$. Substituting into (1): $E = 10 + 2(1) = 12\\,\\text{V}$.",
