    "marks_weightage": 2,
    "marks": 2,
    "question_latex": "A long straight solid copper wire of radius $R$ carries a uniformly distributed steady current $I$. The magnetic field $B$ at distance $r < R$ (inside the wire) varies with $r$ as:",
