    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_latex": "By Snell's law: $n_1 \\sin i = n_2 \\sin r \\implies 1 \\times \\sin 60^\\circ = \\sqrt{3} \\times \\sin r \\implies \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} = \\sqrt{3}\\sin r \\implies \\sin r = \\frac{1}{2} \\implies r = 30^\\circ$.",
