    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_latex": "In air: $\\frac{1}{f_a} = (\\mu_g - 1)K = (1.5 - 1)K = 0.5 K$. In water: $\\frac{1}{f_w} = \\left(\\frac{\\mu_g}{\\mu_w} - 1\\right)K = \\left(\\frac{1.5}{4/3} - 1\\right)K = \\left(\\frac{9}{8} - 1\\right)K = \\frac{1}{8}K$. Taking ratio: $\\frac{f_w}{f_a} = \\frac{0.5}{1/8} = 4 \\implies f_w = 4 f_a = 4(20\\,\\text{cm}) = 80\\,\\text{cm}$.",
